        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>八款最好喝的梅酒</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: {inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']]}\n};\n</script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #f2ece1;\n    font-family: \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"Heiti SC\", sans-serif;\n  }\n  .page {\n    width: 540px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    background: #f4eee3;\n    border: 10px solid #8f2d20;\n    padding: 14px 16px 18px 16px;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  .title-main {\n    text-align: center;\n    color: #8f2d20;\n    font-size: 42px;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n    line-height: 1.1;\n    margin: 6px 0 10px 0;\n    font-family: \"STKaiti\", \"KaiTi\", \"PingFang SC\", serif;\n  }\n  .title-sub {\n    background: #8f2d20;\n    color: #f7f1e6;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 26px;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    letter-spacing: 4px;\n    padding: 8px 0;\n    margin: 0 0 14px 0;\n    font-family: \"STKaiti\", \"KaiTi\", \"PingFang SC\", serif;\n  }\n  .rows { display: flex; flex-direction: column; }\n  .row {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: row;\n    align-items: stretch;\n    padding: 10px 0 12px 0;\n    border-bottom: 1px dashed #b9563f;\n  }\n  .row:last-child { border-bottom: none; }\n  .cell {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: row;\n    width: 50%;\n    gap: 6px;\n  }\n  .cell.right { padding-left: 8px; }\n  .placeholder {\n    width: 80px;\n    min-width: 80px;\n    height: 130px;\n    border: 1px dashed #a9a094;\n    background: #ece4d6;\n    color: #8a8074;\n    font-size: 8px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n    line-height: 1.3;\n    padding: 2px;\n  }\n  .info { flex: 1; }\n  .name {\n    color: #8f2d20;\n    font-size: 19px;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    margin: 0 0 6px 0;\n    letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n    font-family: \"STKaiti\", \"KaiTi\", \"PingFang SC\", serif;\n  }\n  .desc {\n    font-size: 10px;\n    line-height: 1.55;\n    color: #3b3630;\n    margin: 0;\n    text-align: justify;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <h1 class=\"title-main\">八款最好喝的梅酒</h1>\n  <div class=\"title-sub\">女生微醺必备酒款</div>\n\n  <div class=\"rows\">\n\n    <div class=\"row\">\n      <div class=\"cell left\">\n        <figure class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: 山崎梅酒樽仕入 黑色酒瓶]</figure>\n        <div class=\"info\">\n          <div class=\"name\">山崎梅酒樽仕入</div>\n          <p class=\"desc\">山崎入门级梅酒，也是最经典的一款，口感也是接受度最高的一款。目前已经停产，市场上存量越来越少，想喝或者想收藏小伙伴可以尽快尝试一下。</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"cell right\">\n        <figure class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: 山崎梅酒樽酿 浅黄色酒瓶]</figure>\n        <div class=\"info\">\n          <div class=\"name\">山崎梅酒樽酿</div>\n          <p class=\"desc\">代替樽仕入经典酒的新产品，与经典款相同配方，都是使用白兰地作为基酒。但是新款的酒精提到了20度，相比经典香味与烟熏味道更重一些。</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"row\">\n      <div class=\"cell left\">\n        <figure class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: 俏雅黑金本格 CHOYA 酒瓶]</figure>\n        <div class=\"info\">\n          <div class=\"name\">俏雅黑金本格</div>\n          <p class=\"desc\">这是一款白兰地本格梅酒，所以品尝起来会感觉洋酒的味道浓厚一些，可以搭配气泡水一起饮用，口感会更顺滑。</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"cell right\">\n        <figure class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: 杂贺纪州梅酒 白色酒瓶]</figure>\n        <div class=\"info\">\n          <div class=\"name\">杂贺纪州梅酒</div>\n          <p class=\"desc\">闻名遐迩的杂贺清酒为酒底，放入梅子进行浸泡，最后再放入美味的梅子酱，口感浓稠甘甜，而青梅的酸度对健康也有益处。</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"row\">\n      <div class=\"cell left\">\n        <figure class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: 三得利梅酒 橙黄色酒瓶]</figure>\n        <div class=\"info\">\n          <div class=\"name\">三得利梅酒</div>\n          <p class=\"desc\">这款是三得利旗下的经典梅酒，酸甜爽口，口感愉悦，冰镇后梅酒的口感进一步被激发，再加上一杯亦打水，不论是配餐还是睡前独酌都是很好的选择。</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"cell right\">\n        <figure class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: 明石信威士忌梅酒 酒瓶]</figure>\n        <div class=\"info\">\n          <div class=\"name\">明石信威士忌梅酒</div>\n          <p class=\"desc\">女生喜欢的威士忌梅酒，黄金比例的调配，醇厚甜甜的酒体，细腻属风的口感。第一次尝试时，让人很难感觉到威士忌的存在，直到喝完后的回甘才发现它们完美的融合在了一起。</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"row\">\n      <div class=\"cell left\">\n        <figure class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: 蝶矢黑糖梅酒 深色酒瓶]</figure>\n        <div class=\"info\">\n          <div class=\"name\">蝶矢黑糖梅酒</div>\n          <p class=\"desc\">来自冲绳的黑糖与梅酒的完美融合，黑糖里的甘蔗矿物质给梅酒带来了独特的芳香甜味，推荐与牛奶一起搭配，口感顺滑醇厚又饱满~</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"cell right\">\n        <figure class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: 长乐无忧梅酒 礼盒与酒瓶]</figure>\n        <div class=\"info\">\n          <div class=\"name\">长乐无忧梅酒</div>\n          <p class=\"desc\">一款国产的优秀梅酒，被超高颜值吸引来尝试，被其超棒的口感[?]，清爽顺滑的口感，入口后，淡淡的青梅味会一直保留，酒液一滑的甜美，让酒液十分健康，即便是在身材管理的女生也可以放心饮用。</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
